<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-058-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.308116" lon="-120.921189"><name>SC26-058-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 57/100; not catch probability. Center 176 ft; nearby 174–191 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-041</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 125-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.30717682435458" lon="-120.9215979969511"/><trkpt lat="35.30717871434676" lon="-120.92170792408993"/><trkpt lat="35.30736082493982" lon="-120.92181324031654"/><trkpt lat="35.307367720723775" lon="-120.92221438685984"/><trkpt lat="35.30760586265416" lon="-120.92241443404104"/><trkpt lat="35.30802910468051" lon="-120.9225593125578"/><trkpt lat="35.30846557680419" lon="-120.92249557387414"/><trkpt lat="35.308577939764724" lon="-120.92244196396116"/><trkpt lat="35.3084534868037" lon="-120.9224451472575"/><trkpt lat="35.308451597422675" lon="-120.92233521834272"/><trkpt lat="35.30826948722644" lon="-120.92222989963227"/><trkpt lat="35.30826570799027" lon="-120.92201004234082"/><trkpt lat="35.30835581833617" lon="-120.92200773700539"/><trkpt lat="35.30844214902" lon="-120.92178557392224"/><trkpt lat="35.30862236967937" lon="-120.92178096271327"/><trkpt lat="35.30862425957212" lon="-120.92189089182038"/><trkpt lat="35.30880637004352" lon="-120.92199621017478"/><trkpt lat="35.308810149354855" lon="-120.92221606892717"/><trkpt